          "time": "11:00 AM",
          "dateAbove": "Wednesday, July 22nd",
          "text": "Hi all! For founders or hiring leads in this group, you might find this live workshop valuable. We’re hosting a virtual session on how to attract the best systems builders on your team, led by a studio director with 15+ years across distributed product teams.",
          "subText": "You’ll leave with a practical playbook for attracting top candidates, evaluating craft, and building teams that move faster without compromising quality.\nJul 30, 11:00 AM PDT",
